    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i just went through the latest Q3 data for CardioZen. we are way behind on the market share targets and we really need to push for that 20% increase this quarter. i need you to put together some key talking points for the reps to use when doctors bring up the side-effect profile compared to the main competitor. doctors are noticing we have a slightly higher rate of mild dizziness, and we need to handle that objection effectively so it doesn't stall our adoption. what should the reps be saying?",
